-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nThe <b>Celestial Blossom</b> is a flower found in vines under a few arches around <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay\" title=\"Finlay\">Finlay</a>. This flower is mostly found on vines below arches/cave roofs, especially around the high areas of the <a href=\"/wiki/Flowering_Meadows\" title=\"Flowering Meadows\">Flowering Meadows</a>.\n</p><p>It isn't on all vines of <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay\" title=\"Finlay\">Finlay</a>, which otherwise spawns in <a href=\"/wiki/Grapes\" title=\"Grapes\">Grapes</a> or nothing at all.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"a02d03d35cb9e0535b834927d92cd3a8\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\">Locations (might not be all of them yet)</div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:129px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"CBlossomL1-webp\" style=\"position: relative; height:69px; width:185px; top:29px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:CBlossomL1.webp\" title=\"CBlossomL1.webp (388 KB)\" style=\"height:69px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/48/CBlossomL1.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20250628040729\" title=\"CBlossomL1.webp (388 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Location 1 of the Celestial Blossom, found near Flora Laura.\" height=\"127\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"CBlossomL1.webp\" data-image-key=\"CBlossomL1.webp\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Location 1 of the Celestial Blossom, found near .\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=